{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given a string `s` of uppercase letters and an integer `k`, you may change **at most k** characters to any other uppercase letter. Return the length of the longest substring that can then consist of **one repeated letter**."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/6b706923-4125-4c07-9874-c871c38ccc06.svg",
      "alt": "s is A A B A B B A with k equal to 1. The window A A B A, the first four letters, has three A's and one B. Replacing the single B gives A A A A, length 4. No longer window needs only one replacement, so the answer is 4.",
      "width": 698,
      "height": 307,
